{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116092016225-1116_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261116092016\"/><p>綿羊仔尾轆飛脫。</p><p>觀塘繞道發生交通意外。今日(16日)早上7時46分，一輛綿羊仔電單車沿路往旺角方向行駛，至近太子道東支路時自炒，綿羊仔尾轆飛脫，鐵騎士手部受傷清醒由救護車送院治理，肇事原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T01:30:04.197861+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T01:20:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:23:37.418452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T01:23:37.418452+00:00","content_hash":"2743ad16b23e5524c7ccc87be4bc000ac7e3d08228bacb5a0d0510a5e80930aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}